But then, after the termites ate 30%, the tree's weight is 70% of that. So I need to take 8000 pounds times 0.70. Let me do that multiplication. 8000 times 0.7 is the same as 8000 * 7 / 10. 8000 divided by 10 is 800, then times 7 is 5600. So the final weight would be 5600 pounds?

